      "id": "claim_ae4d772a5206451f81ece851b38ef9fc",
      "statement": "The Postgres database schema (tables, constraints, RLS policies, SQL functions, Realtime publication, and scheduled jobs) is defined entirely by timestamp-prefixed SQL files in supabase/migrations/, which the Supabase CLI applies in lexicographic order; the `pnpm supabase:migrate` script wraps `supabase migration up`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L20-L20",
