      "id": "claim_f9ba381e8b1f44419d6c849ae6b5a9c1",
      "statement": "Production setup requires setting CRON_SECRET in the Vercel environment and running `alter database postgres set app.app_url = ...` and `alter database postgres set app.cron_secret = ...` in Supabase, where app.cron_secret must equal the Vercel CRON_SECRET or every scheduled POST is rejected with 401; job execution is verified by querying cron.job_run_details filtered by jobname 'sweep-stale-matches'.",
